+B Limitations
+
+This report analyses the public repository branch inspected on 4 November 2026. The team’s local
+working copy may contain changes that are not present in that branch. The report does not claim
+that infrastructure-level controls are absent merely because they are not implemented in application
+code. In particular, disk encryption, backup protection, server permissions, organisational SSO and
+IPA document storage require confirmation from the relevant infrastructure owners. The default
+values described in W1-06 depend on the Streamlit version and on the content of the drop-down file.
